  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "死是多么容易想到的事，可是白涤洲的死大概朋友们谁也没想到吧？",
      "output_sha256": "86ec9ccb5087d9f57a7accacc97edbb1a57e303509e3fb8cd41df249afaf017b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "86ec9ccb5087d9f57a7accacc97edbb1a57e303509e3fb8cd41df249afaf017b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这才使人跺脚！",
      "output_sha256": "102946fa54c5f5b070971165d9227156bc351801ee288873b92d46be3a083b7a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "102946fa54c5f5b070971165d9227156bc351801ee288873b92d46be3a083b7a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "才三十多岁，天不怕地不怕——因为身体好——精明强干，舍己从人，涤洲，竟自死了；谁在事前敢这么想，谁是疯子；而今“天”是疯了；从青岛到北平，我的泪不能干，不能干！",
      "output_sha256": "66a254d726cba7e3d6f0048776bbdcc6d2538305482740f095a6370a0ae451bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "66a254d726cba7e3d6f0048776bbdcc6d2538305482740f095a6370a0ae451bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十六七岁的时候，我俩是同学。",
      "output_sha256": "800ff44c4fca097a7967974737b54fa959f051417a98a5269343e5f875a8a483",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "800ff44c4fca097a7967974737b54fa959f051417a98a5269343e5f875a8a483",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽然我们隔着班级，却总是特别投缘。",
      "output_sha256": "54dcee0398d82c324d0c23f22926acb01f3ae13e9e4c1c6ce2b2c7bf9e304ce4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.384575,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d00d02e207848598e73c5ee3728dce9e2f7dbb41646086f4b326ae8efc31f792"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "54dcee0398d82c324d0c23f22926acb01f3ae13e9e4c1c6ce2b2c7bf9e304ce4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那时，他总是偏着头，穿着蓝色的校服，身材不矮，常常在考试中名列前茅。",
      "output_sha256": "6478e644de2ca75fd748d8562d69c6dae368660f76ed92070b7c428bc7d2efac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.473783,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f19ec47f79b2ba9b29f124bae977f373d4dc6fbbc2c349de7b1201e228d857a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6478e644de2ca75fd748d8562d69c6dae368660f76ed92070b7c428bc7d2efac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有的同学和他好，有的不大对劲儿；没人恨他。",
      "output_sha256": "57a3902d299aeb03fe4dc6f7adb8e13a1a27c727db733c0864327d04ff10a049",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "57a3902d299aeb03fe4dc6f7adb8e13a1a27c727db733c0864327d04ff10a049",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他简单质朴，带着一点乡土气息，爱说笑话，幽默而宽厚。",
      "output_sha256": "69a9cf71e5a80d9bda1bc0d1a758741537e3a041315e4dae13ea9fa719ab4ad8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.479545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "baa640b541793c7a79cc48631388ac14a0dc5081feb62c8206a491be740741db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69a9cf71e5a80d9bda1bc0d1a758741537e3a041315e4dae13ea9fa719ab4ad8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说起西山来，他的眼——老那么扣扣着点——发了光。",
      "output_sha256": "e68ed1e0c515d2773c3570b4c531283b86273c35f33bcc77e265cca96474f7c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "e68ed1e0c515d2773c3570b4c531283b86273c35f33bcc77e265cca96474f7c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他得意，自称为山精。",
      "output_sha256": "4276300557c67972e943c6e8ef8f4646deb825ea1f7c2b0b5e906d271dbe1e98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "4276300557c67972e943c6e8ef8f4646deb825ea1f7c2b0b5e906d271dbe1e98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们相处融洽，但我始终觉得他没有特别吸引我的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "895fd8f64c4d46bd4080a52401f035ee23724fd90b4370d221b73ba8f1bb68a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.414777,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "40b34dcd8e34575341ba74e40f6b4ef803b1d805ccd1a6eacfa655a9a862e202"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "895fd8f64c4d46bd4080a52401f035ee23724fd90b4370d221b73ba8f1bb68a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我承认他聪明，没脾气，可是我同时怕他只为考第一，样样功课叫好，而落得什么也不真好；天才往往倒不见得考第一。",
      "output_sha256": "92485900a2627baf7622f758afa87de53f376cece73f96a642c1ee7e9a25b766",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "92485900a2627baf7622f758afa87de53f376cece73f96a642c1ee7e9a25b766",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对他的脾气也是这样，我怕他为太讨好而学圆滑了；我爱硬干的人。",
      "output_sha256": "ecf051eb938cb00fe3e085bf093a53df8c942e72157363fce57b916f9ae75b16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "ecf051eb938cb00fe3e085bf093a53df8c942e72157363fce57b916f9ae75b16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他在师范学校毕业后就派作了校长，接我的手。",
      "output_sha256": "79817fa1e8b5c5c4ff5d48aa544b985b5162a67bed904a2a0962056d3e0aaac2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "79817fa1e8b5c5c4ff5d48aa544b985b5162a67bed904a2a0962056d3e0aaac2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这段时间里，我们的友谊加深了不少，我也开始意识到他的能力和为人处世的宽厚。",
      "output_sha256": "fbb02f5dce34e0427f687484e2b890010bd149882bb51a9800c9038d62b97817",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.358571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36d58e03c79fdea26e09251287efe76847d55c3ff1fed8297bac271a74ec7040"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fbb02f5dce34e0427f687484e2b890010bd149882bb51a9800c9038d62b97817",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我这才明白：他的精明使他更忠厚——本来应当更圆滑——这就是说，他“肯”吃亏。",
      "output_sha256": "ff40b634ac965d71fd69622e8bf3acca8140dc85cf5d3f0290ab3960833b020e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff40b634ac965d71fd69622e8bf3acca8140dc85cf5d3f0290ab3960833b020e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他总会向朋友们倾诉，借此幽默的方式来发泄不快。",
      "output_sha256": "2f9314563789e9775c4373a03978bfca683c5c918bf56aff02e94d7162c7ec62",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.411667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ea25a7536b63c6492fb0260182c814b46ecb56fa1866c0df492f293582cbaf85"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f9314563789e9775c4373a03978bfca683c5c918bf56aff02e94d7162c7ec62",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若没有人倾诉，他是无法承受的。",
      "output_sha256": "93347a7fe2e3fafb2ac2c7463a5eeb2c58c3b4e6698a5bb2d3f5eab0b774119a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.367252,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce6dafd185b3a9cb8958f1edde702d58f89bf71c19b2ff5c2451684d4df76107"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "93347a7fe2e3fafb2ac2c7463a5eeb2c58c3b4e6698a5bb2d3f5eab0b774119a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个人必须有些好友，他自己是个好朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "b3308110317e985ccb04a3a58c4bb4beb8e0fe905d132faf6011a2cff4910624",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "b3308110317e985ccb04a3a58c4bb4beb8e0fe905d132faf6011a2cff4910624",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想不起更足以表现他整个人格的称号；对，只有“好朋友”，大家有什么事都找他。",
      "output_sha256": "197abb4d8e573d1bee7734a290dabc712c50d4af5cc99721900c103c7a44f1c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "197abb4d8e573d1bee7734a290dabc712c50d4af5cc99721900c103c7a44f1c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有时候因为事的琐细，他说声“他妈的”，可是马上穿起大衫，不怕是在怎样劳累以后，还是去给办那件小事。",
      "output_sha256": "a919b3c60ce56201cb47c49f3c6d4b40f670c6cefc7dfb2cbb4a564eac737a14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "a919b3c60ce56201cb47c49f3c6d4b40f670c6cefc7dfb2cbb4a564eac737a14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "什么都是他，钱归他拿着，房契由他保存，书在他那里堆着。",
      "output_sha256": "7c9105e17a1a6a13d15642fcd90d19bda2b3831dcdf65a411a556405d871eb97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c9105e17a1a6a13d15642fcd90d19bda2b3831dcdf65a411a556405d871eb97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "只要他开心，对一切都点头称是。",
      "output_sha256": "f1f8376d7f0784db4a9bf087c279c1ebc539d06af1c73a81571d1f973300166d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.342887,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "17dd9baee62213d7f4ca925a23dad5d37fd5a60cd94fa5731cbb60dc8d28698d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f1f8376d7f0784db4a9bf087c279c1ebc539d06af1c73a81571d1f973300166d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "啊，涤洲，你的死，我们大家都负着责任。",
      "output_sha256": "3e1b50fe194a48899ff12576884e790bada816c8e101e4b6936f4b75abfd41ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e1b50fe194a48899ff12576884e790bada816c8e101e4b6936f4b75abfd41ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你是累死了。",
      "output_sha256": "05f89fdfd3a95ccae177ea0cc24a095bfe5d6e8b7ae77f25f21b8b98de646679",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "05f89fdfd3a95ccae177ea0cc24a095bfe5d6e8b7ae77f25f21b8b98de646679",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在小学校界里几年，他成了很重要的人物。",
      "output_sha256": "fc7d72682fa4c30a6850582b53ca46fc671c69d3a5da1eae361ade37933fc93c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc7d72682fa4c30a6850582b53ca46fc671c69d3a5da1eae361ade37933fc93c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "几位好友都意识到：涤洲不能这样继续下去，他应该继续深造，他有这样的才华。",
      "output_sha256": "34877b3028c496c360afff1fc51ca5ac996808e300317b3881295796873339bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.519475,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d425bdd0ae84d6448536a182849c8dd41d08ab317fcad19883c74853735a50cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "34877b3028c496c360afff1fc51ca5ac996808e300317b3881295796873339bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他盘算了一番，只接收这个建议，而不接收任何人的金钱。",
      "output_sha256": "764bc43f94f470f3ce48f0d2808857273612c8824589fe46ff0f0157e2a3ef0b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "764bc43f94f470f3ce48f0d2808857273612c8824589fe46ff0f0157e2a3ef0b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他考入了北大。",
      "output_sha256": "86944ef8b3f29288ceecb3e3aa6bbf544308012b318a80a3b384453c3633d198",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "86944ef8b3f29288ceecb3e3aa6bbf544308012b318a80a3b384453c3633d198",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一边求学，一边还得养活一家子人。",
      "output_sha256": "04c4dce8a51f7c7e4aae495b2482e432a6fcfc7a3b2896b5560d8f885ac311e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "04c4dce8a51f7c7e4aae495b2482e432a6fcfc7a3b2896b5560d8f885ac311e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他又接了我的事，在教育会里作干事。",
      "output_sha256": "67d9954f9f446b9dc91813b86ffb4ab6a74891b42cd029ce744afed10491df57",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "67d9954f9f446b9dc91813b86ffb4ab6a74891b42cd029ce744afed10491df57",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家都说：“涤洲和舍予是一对儿。”",
      "output_sha256": "f86c3876ee8f931d9238e88145f36aaec94b8f3c2c4494defd0eb3a7e33fb2d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "f86c3876ee8f931d9238e88145f36aaec94b8f3c2c4494defd0eb3a7e33fb2d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其实，我怎么能与他相提并论呢？",
      "output_sha256": "ddfd13020d889478874f797e755762e3df6cd9ba00c1d85f6925a8d1836456ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.411731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b8830a0e845a45d69d02d3a9f712ea543dca960c3d0602076a1635fa46d2cbb6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ddfd13020d889478874f797e755762e3df6cd9ba00c1d85f6925a8d1836456ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就以我们的事情而言，我的钱都由他管理，明明他那么忙。",
      "output_sha256": "a6d188bd2f5041729332a267573fee7f65d79312614d95fde309978c05e24829",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.598743,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5520e33fbc2d1aff10b1660a6b37d7fe2f75dff443e72cd2593df4bbb0258b6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6d188bd2f5041729332a267573fee7f65d79312614d95fde309978c05e24829",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的家人，他给照应着。",
      "output_sha256": "a294cedbae48c55f6d06b963ec3ea850eb5896154c72398b8c13fb5a54bef216",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "a294cedbae48c55f6d06b963ec3ea850eb5896154c72398b8c13fb5a54bef216",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的书，他代保存着；有人借去一本书，他都写个小条钉在书架上。",
      "output_sha256": "afd37a759ebd73b8f9f466b5cadaa6150540a8bd228a86ff8367360f4d56de7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "afd37a759ebd73b8f9f466b5cadaa6150540a8bd228a86ff8367360f4d56de7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "回到北平，我住在他家。",
      "output_sha256": "0818f5fcaf0b8c328c360cb3fdd55236e203dc82c7313095cda31aee50259231",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "0818f5fcaf0b8c328c360cb3fdd55236e203dc82c7313095cda31aee50259231",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我帮助了他什么呢？",
      "output_sha256": "355153e0be1fecaf222a29c759130e35fdcce8c63cde2b8a05996450c6b2ccc4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "355153e0be1fecaf222a29c759130e35fdcce8c63cde2b8a05996450c6b2ccc4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "还不就是能彼此谈得来，他能和我谈那些带“他妈的”的话？",
      "output_sha256": "54fb643e83c7d450ba3a20c3dbfe1e9f216bcafe42dfff632a2734092fa43949",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "54fb643e83c7d450ba3a20c3dbfe1e9f216bcafe42dfff632a2734092fa43949",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "夏天我住在他那儿，他满身大汗地回家，抱着个大西瓜。",
      "output_sha256": "127471e52e977da191105acd50724d2cc9c3fdb15132d90c5be0536787801beb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.629177,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f6a3cc801ad6c3c3e360cfd803d893b1a168b5e9bf5548757c1c1b32a644b2ce"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "127471e52e977da191105acd50724d2cc9c3fdb15132d90c5be0536787801beb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "脱去外衣，他找刀：“来，舍予，看看我怎么切这个！”",
      "output_sha256": "dff46b5e3166ca8601295b279704b7f50d3f9f7ed1e97638a11bfab40a2d0707",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.577778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a421106f96bca5bc8d360eeb0220660ffc8e22accda008d16cc5df24dd1c4714"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dff46b5e3166ca8601295b279704b7f50d3f9f7ed1e97638a11bfab40a2d0707",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "吃了瓜，他脱了袜子，脚登在椅上，和我说起来。",
      "output_sha256": "af842f7833842b8740a2b8e40d2297c75b0679e09bf491b68969bc8462564cff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "af842f7833842b8740a2b8e40d2297c75b0679e09bf491b68969bc8462564cff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在他的谈话里，永远不自傲；对于学问，他常叹气；对于作人，他才肯点头——“我是个好人！”",
      "output_sha256": "e589cdff58cbc22b2fb9bbb9c9156b0bd85ba85e09bc55cd4b51facf7084deea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "e589cdff58cbc22b2fb9bbb9c9156b0bd85ba85e09bc55cd4b51facf7084deea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他向我倾诉那些吃亏受累的事，手——那微微修长的手——拍在腿上：“嘿，差点忘了给老杨定铺位，他后天就要去南京。”",
      "output_sha256": "29af1990d55b176d992fad74dfdd6c434e39bf56a8a7dc71d358c8b9b2baf1b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.622458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a673cd344f0dbe3f50b19b5019cdbd128cd4e56a03ba5318af0678163c24e3f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "29af1990d55b176d992fad74dfdd6c434e39bf56a8a7dc71d358c8b9b2baf1b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他又跑了，甭管天气多热。",
      "output_sha256": "05cc2ccd913e242de6c5c0247c451a65bc22b0fe011288f7b152b7bbe224a5f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "05cc2ccd913e242de6c5c0247c451a65bc22b0fe011288f7b152b7bbe224a5f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这样繁忙的几年里，他竟然成了一位学者。",
      "output_sha256": "f2fa1c3ec0a682237e8393d92c0771db7dffb6b893a4f08840117d3800846e35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.533352,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcfb5f5976b10f52bced6f342cdaee78efab3ca10162d2be6a89076fddc22572"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2fa1c3ec0a682237e8393d92c0771db7dffb6b893a4f08840117d3800846e35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "什么我都敢希望他，除了成为学者。",
      "output_sha256": "09d5a696825a8777a8a9897ac520fef2ac58a407feac9d6c95b77f2eb21dbdf6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "09d5a696825a8777a8a9897ac520fef2ac58a407feac9d6c95b77f2eb21dbdf6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他堵了我的嘴，可是激动了我的心。",
      "output_sha256": "b884c79ba4844999ae9bf0e70854cd6ef962dee9f4f0a872db3efe30973fb784",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "b884c79ba4844999ae9bf0e70854cd6ef962dee9f4f0a872db3efe30973fb784",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不知怎样对他好了：应帮助他成为学者——自然第一是先别求他办事了。",
      "output_sha256": "14b64b884e44d435afb4ec3e6a1f17ed1c4f59637450be21d04a81db7d6197bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "14b64b884e44d435afb4ec3e6a1f17ed1c4f59637450be21d04a81db7d6197bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不求他办事，难道行得通吗？",
      "output_sha256": "057619037ac88e6e34dbeeeff4c5f3d76ffcd18c99d66f38731598a52dc393e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.544351,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6691fa40e7ad545a6d7f2e2c1cd4e27457d4b562960180fc4df694cc315cfd5f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "057619037ac88e6e34dbeeeff4c5f3d76ffcd18c99d66f38731598a52dc393e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他是我最大的依靠！",
      "output_sha256": "1bc067824606ef2049c0d81a980c3e57816a525a16c0c48924aef758e1ba6cc7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.494545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a716fce193ebff70d29553a8f90a459cb99f179ae9a39d51b1997efca745d90a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1bc067824606ef2049c0d81a980c3e57816a525a16c0c48924aef758e1ba6cc7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "求他办事？",
      "output_sha256": "c3f196fdb8c0177dfd7e5dda41ef0752e13d81cfd2ba83bd45440069c09ce114",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "c3f196fdb8c0177dfd7e5dda41ef0752e13d81cfd2ba83bd45440069c09ce114",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这无疑会耽误他的学习。",
      "output_sha256": "196391bbf0c99b1fb2778ef987a8af593ed10e40ce429bb3a39b50e1312a42c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.434474,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "87bb05da26da1f225b4a229da14455cfff2a4bdf586977e8484f8900789fe783"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "196391bbf0c99b1fb2778ef987a8af593ed10e40ce429bb3a39b50e1312a42c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友，涤洲，恐怕不是我一个人对你这样吧？",
      "output_sha256": "818453d3c32e85517addf96184683e22218313037da186372802216c6e22819e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "818453d3c32e85517addf96184683e22218313037da186372802216c6e22819e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们早已想过，而事情最终都得依靠你来处理。",
      "output_sha256": "6c3abc164e2046bfda59b1cd9c6556997a9a0299acb9f44d2912fd6c8d82d338",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.462267,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8f60a742aec8b44f1268a6ef5aeae96f4ab4941c56b391d58b305e07826758a7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6c3abc164e2046bfda59b1cd9c6556997a9a0299acb9f44d2912fd6c8d82d338",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "只有你能做好，只有你愿意为我们付出。",
      "output_sha256": "7a95f23f463f92c85b5c52cd62a968890bed9e075c3a99a5b31c69cbdb836b8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.530933,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1be021a12e9a6c5c1b30637d2a157476ab2bf714197441328417e0f13fd0bb86"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7a95f23f463f92c85b5c52cd62a968890bed9e075c3a99a5b31c69cbdb836b8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你是散处各方的朋友的总办事处。",
      "output_sha256": "9cfa4e4c906fa726ff06e81b81d38df1df791177a0bb9e25f722af457add443f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "9cfa4e4c906fa726ff06e81b81d38df1df791177a0bb9e25f722af457add443f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你死了，涤洲，我们……说什么呢？！",
      "output_sha256": "7d9f4b373af2b10e2206bdd435e20c29b04c5f40c38feafca609fcb0aa7d8340",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d9f4b373af2b10e2206bdd435e20c29b04c5f40c38feafca609fcb0aa7d8340",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "眼泪有什么用呢？！",
      "output_sha256": "ce1289be87604e7712ffc066c53cf93848e9c20a112760a45638c503465d8a73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce1289be87604e7712ffc066c53cf93848e9c20a112760a45638c503465d8a73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十天没有接到你的信，我还心里说：莘田到了北平，热闹起来，忘了我！",
      "output_sha256": "32f53b73c58691b976553714eec6c4d553aaad307d4ff71fd03bcc1e33cd5fd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "32f53b73c58691b976553714eec6c4d553aaad307d4ff71fd03bcc1e33cd5fd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我还——该死！",
      "output_sha256": "f816ae352000a89265f6a493dd5a5e510bf095978c460d5d34e6d3f3a3b4925a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "f816ae352000a89265f6a493dd5a5e510bf095978c460d5d34e6d3f3a3b4925a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——给你汇钱，详详细细的写信，托你给办事。",
      "output_sha256": "54099d2fcbf97a2bc72cfae925ba53761d08340d5d4ac2c661b644a068e6c67e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "54099d2fcbf97a2bc72cfae925ba53761d08340d5d4ac2c661b644a068e6c67e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "钱汇到北平，电报到了青岛——涤洲病故！",
      "output_sha256": "33235b9507d2f864410c362f4ea9239af0fa70c7b0ec9a176fbcf77539741fbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "33235b9507d2f864410c362f4ea9239af0fa70c7b0ec9a176fbcf77539741fbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每次我到北平，洗澡、吃饭、购物、看戏，都有你陪伴；而这次，你却独自安卧在法源寺。",
      "output_sha256": "b78b9114c0d7e2c2e55a0e5e412c70eb6ca51e363ed697578802f4258ad672ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": 0.623159,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ec5f8d868339218d323dbda7098512eab251f571531efe5712a92cf6ee871b40"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b78b9114c0d7e2c2e55a0e5e412c70eb6ca51e363ed697578802f4258ad672ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你的一切，我知道。",
      "output_sha256": "57a1ffb0543fbb98285ab291b5109d7b8561cfa656da8592cf17ddb1ee164ec4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "57a1ffb0543fbb98285ab291b5109d7b8561cfa656da8592cf17ddb1ee164ec4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的高大身材，深色衣服，手，脸，思考时总是咬着下唇……这些都记得，唯独你已不在，仿佛一场梦！",
      "output_sha256": "e6bd4e54c67e03bfb77b4b777a68dad1396523ff6305080b1c23d1de8c2ae5dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.484952,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab1cb88b4788be36c479b7473169f4e5deced741e53a1a9f54f1d381b0dd84a3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e6bd4e54c67e03bfb77b4b777a68dad1396523ff6305080b1c23d1de8c2ae5dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你这一辈子，受过多少累，吃过多少苦，家中遭了多大的变故，你总不灰心，始终努力，就这样死了吗？",
      "output_sha256": "266348b943176be6de606a103b5075d5f8bd03d859c55c81376ac17946a8dfcb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "266348b943176be6de606a103b5075d5f8bd03d859c55c81376ac17946a8dfcb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "前年我由济南赶来，是为祭你的夫人，安慰你。",
      "output_sha256": "844924b383980b8469b238a4be94e5abce8819a79cbda16546540e09fd9c7f8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "844924b383980b8469b238a4be94e5abce8819a79cbda16546540e09fd9c7f8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你还是笑着，泪终日在眼眶里。",
      "output_sha256": "4b60f663e66f495115a2151881176db586b4b9b484f9624294d1022f01757dde",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b60f663e66f495115a2151881176db586b4b9b484f9624294d1022f01757dde",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "去年你过济南，我们谈了半夜。",
      "output_sha256": "1f29c90a5fa55aa19845d31986e166115160e9e39118dd141202b89eb8edead2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f29c90a5fa55aa19845d31986e166115160e9e39118dd141202b89eb8edead2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你老那么高兴，要强，不怕，你老是我们中最年少最有为的一位——朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "41e30fee10a255235e7a3f92f433dc2208f0f80cca53af496e0053ba80248222",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "41e30fee10a255235e7a3f92f433dc2208f0f80cca53af496e0053ba80248222",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友！",
      "output_sha256": "73502977a3dff4615ce397f30ca86976e04a4992bf608ccb2917a5d27b729b1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "73502977a3dff4615ce397f30ca86976e04a4992bf608ccb2917a5d27b729b1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你决不肯——我知道——弃舍了我们。",
      "output_sha256": "b69813760e3d27e9e66746faa649e4e5a97ed172a2632f3dcf82109ad7aae4ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "b69813760e3d27e9e66746faa649e4e5a97ed172a2632f3dcf82109ad7aae4ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你在我们心中老活着。",
      "output_sha256": "b2df9cc5a779cdc11ce86fd2e2dd104c65b1e4dfa00f5262ca7a1e252763b75a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2df9cc5a779cdc11ce86fd2e2dd104c65b1e4dfa00f5262ca7a1e252763b75a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "想起你，会激励我们努力做人，努力学习。",
      "output_sha256": "5287d419d106bf7b4d2791069e286d36fd054de9fae5c39933685731c8ae0be0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.644318,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2fefc69bee4ad3b3613929d773640baab5dca160ccf9b71710df9fe60eab7fcf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5287d419d106bf7b4d2791069e286d36fd054de9fae5c39933685731c8ae0be0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "生命是短暂的，做好坏事都是一样的——早晚都要死。",
      "output_sha256": "49761b7020a00d56316934d39f1832d3992c38f74858aaf9bf6316d7ae201aac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": 0.587778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        76
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad44914637dea62cbd905c8d9a89d79aec599e5c67c6af2f32af206d23d8d045"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_ai_sha256": "49761b7020a00d56316934d39f1832d3992c38f74858aaf9bf6316d7ae201aac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        74
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你走在我们前面，让我们明白：要快点做好，生命是短促的。",
      "output_sha256": "166320a0173e9f44973851f313f622495b74d671b8325014877ab065442fee00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": 0.492933,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        77
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ec53cd989b4c6fdab9dd1b4837f19fabe56b93a4c90af5eddc247e9328f0128"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_ai_sha256": "166320a0173e9f44973851f313f622495b74d671b8325014877ab065442fee00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "涤洲，我再也说不出什么。",
      "output_sha256": "28eba3c87cdc8530e956243327c8458a0f494eddaebfad7e5c5e2da62f2a2ac0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": 0.735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        78
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ae31a01a1f5ef36af4b482e926c6fea4e3e137f4bd4bcb9df15726fd9e9faba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_ai_sha256": "28eba3c87cdc8530e956243327c8458a0f494eddaebfad7e5c5e2da62f2a2ac0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        76
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我只能叫几声“好朋友”，哭着跑回青岛。",
      "output_sha256": "ab1039f2ebf49dfdfaf97b0cd349e33409cb84ff35bbdfd2b17a5e0e29099735",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 79,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab1039f2ebf49dfdfaf97b0cd349e33409cb84ff35bbdfd2b17a5e0e29099735",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人们说我们是一对儿，唉！！！",
      "output_sha256": "2b191450bc2577b36834db6588a2dc34505470e8c8c95b80ef50a9441b5bc389",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": 0.625714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        80
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "92524dacb5a7b7a821da7be88f5c1efe2354dd0c0b170a8eb5b94f1c62cc3a1e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b191450bc2577b36834db6588a2dc34505470e8c8c95b80ef50a9441b5bc389",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        78
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "廿三年十月十七，北平",
      "output_sha256": "5e8ad370f40e554aaec8f7fff1fa3458bbad3db155a0fa2c9cd094211790dda6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 78,
      "alignment_score": null,
